  "status": "accepted",
  "summary": "A worker-job revision is an immutable record under the work item; on workflow.implementation v24 and workflow.break_fix v21 every admitted lane at a job-capable step binds one ready revision through the packet, the dispatch evidence, the report, and the acceptance. Verification requires recorded executable checks. A plain accept of a job-bound attempt satisfies that revision and holds the step without delivery. Whole-work delivery keeps complete admission. Only acceptance that satisfies an unresolved obligation closes its correction window, refining CD-0164 D1-D2 and amending CD-0198 D4.",
